e this  particular abnormal was super impressive  because it managed to be so quiet that  it avoided being detected by kuklo who  by that point in the series was like a  titan radar who could always sense when  they were approaching  finally the last abnormal i wanted to  mention was mammon whose death was  arguably the most important of any pure  titan in history as you'll see in a  second without this titan the cervical  would have been permanently disbanded  many years ago and if that happened then  it's hard to imagine what people like  armin and everyone would have done with  their lives  starting at the beginning malmon broke  into gigantic 70 years before the main  series when the front gate was opened by  titan worshipping cult this cult is the  same one that elena joined after she  went crazy and after mammoth entered the  gate over 5000 people were confirmed to  have died  at this point in the timeline odm gear  as we know it wasn't a thing and more  importantly nobody knew how to kill a  titan so the garrison and the survey  call were pretty much useless when it  came to stopping his rampage  in the manga we got a good look at how  ma'mon casually walked through  shigachina eating whoever he wanted and  at one point he cornered a bunch of  civilians and was picking them off one  by one  despite the crazy amount of victims the  royal government forbid people from  talking about this incident after it was  over and erase all traces of it from the  record something which i think is  believable given that we've seen mps do  similar things in the present day  anyhow the first person maman ate during  his rampage was the pregnant elena but  somehow her baby managed to survive and  was born once the titan vomited them out  hence why cuckoo was often referred to  as the titan son  other people eaten include karina who  was the assistant to angel alternan aka  the guy who would invent the odm gear  that we know today  it was due to his rage about karina's  death t